See CHAPTER11-PAINPOINTS for the findings. These probe files are kept because each
settled a question before it was built, which is the practice worth keeping; the
production versions are std/group/{homomorphism,factor,correspondence,
first-isomorphism}.b4m and std/subgroup/product.b4m.
